In the modern form, {{och-l|*木}} and {{och-l|*豆}} have fused into {{och-l|*壴}}, and the character is sometimes mistaken for a compound of {{och-l|*壴}} + {{och-l|*寸}};.

This character has largely been superseded by {{och-l|樹}}.

